  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Loose offset-printed cards issued in envelope; title from envelope.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Synopsis: This playful tongue-in-cheek book is a child's game of dress-up using a paper figure and tabbed paper outfits ready to be cut out. The figure is "Dottie" and the eight paper outfits, are hand-drawn and range from beach wear to formal attire, some with accessories like a hat and sunglasses. A small paper cut-out stand is also provided. Dottie and her paper wardrobe are printed on a paper with an all-over pattern on the back. Encased in a simple white envelope. Nichols gives special thanks on the envelope to Jo Anne and Chad."--Printed Matter.</subfield>
  </datafield>
